{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 29, :comments ["<b>And harm befalls him.</b> For the Satan prosecutes at a time of danger (Bereshit Rabbah)." "<b>And you shall bring down my gray hairs, etc.</b> Now while he is with me, I find comfort in him for his mother and for his brother — and if this one too dies, it seems to me as though all three died on one day."], :book :genesis, :voice :rashi, :lang :en, :chapter 44, :notes {}, :source-witnesses nil, :timestamp "2026-08-02T09:03:30.304153420Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}